post.description:
Grant access to a resource.

Requires 'owner' relation on the resource to share it.

Request:
```json
{
  "subject": {
    "type": "group",
    "id": "uuid"
  },
  "relation": "editor",
  "resource": {
    "type": "tasks.board",
    "id": "uuid"
  },
  "expires_at": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z"  // Optional
}
```

delete.description:
Revoke access from a resource.

Requires 'owner' relation on the resource.

Request:
```json
{
  "subject": {
    "type": "group",
    "id": "uuid"
  },
  "relation": "editor",  // Optional, null = revoke all relations
  "resource": {
    "type": "tasks.board",
    "id": "uuid"
  }
}
```

get.description:
Get list of who has access to an entity.

Note: Any authenticated user can view the access list. Modify permissions
(grant/revoke) still requires owner relation.

Response:
```json
{
  "access": [
    {
      "subject": {"type": "user", "id": "uuid", "name": "Sarah Chen"},
      "relation": "owner",
      "source": "direct",
      "granted_at": "2025-01-15T10:30:00Z"
    },
    {
      "subject": {"type": "group", "id": "uuid", "name": "Sales Team"},
      "relation": "viewer",
      "source": "rule",
      "source_rule": {"id": "uuid", "name": "Team Visibility"}
    }
  ],
  "inherited_access": [
    {
      "subject": {"type": "user", "id": "uuid", "name": "John Doe"},
      "relation": "editor",
      "source": "inherited",
      "source_detail": "Via workspace: Project Alpha"
    }
  ],
  "parent_entity": {
    "type": "tasks.workspace",
    "id": "uuid",
    "name": "Project Alpha"
  }
}
```

List all roles in the tenant.

Response:
```json
{
  "roles": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "Admin",
      "description": "Full access to all tenant resources",
      "is_system_role": true,
      "is_custom": false,
      "permissions": ["*.*.*"]
    }
  ]
}
```

post.description:
Add an entity link to an item.

Body: { "entity_ref": "crm_contacts:uuid" }

Links the item to a CRM or other module entity.

Perform bulk operations on multiple items.

Supported operations:
- update_status: Change status of items. data: {status: string}
- update_priority: Change priority of items. data: {priority: string}
- assign: Set assignees (replaces existing). data: {user_ids: string[]}
- add_labels: Add labels to items. data: {label_ids: string[]}
- remove_labels: Remove labels from items. data: {label_ids: string[]}
- move_to_group: Move items to a group. data: {group_id: string|null}
- delete: Soft delete items. data: {}

Start avatar session and get WebRTC configuration.

POST /api/v1/avatars/sessions/:id/start
Body: {"mode": "chat"|"voice"}

Switch session mode between chat and voice.

POST /api/v1/avatars/sessions/:id/mode
Body: {"mode": "chat"|"voice"}

